{
  "bookId": "rewind-11",
  "id": "chapter-49",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "noticeKind": "placeholder",
          "text": "原文中的动态称谓保留为占位符：|101|＝玩家昵称；|102|＝按玩家性别变化的称谓；|103|＝按玩家性别变化的敬称。",
          "type": "notice"
        }
      ],
      "id": "reading-note",
      "title": "阅读说明"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "6825001",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "晚间5:10，急速行驶的卡车，无声的对峙。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6825002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "警探大人，人家究竟犯了什么罪嘛！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6825003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "心动杀人罪。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6825004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "喜欢吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6825005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "这可真不像是警署口中能够说出的话呀。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6825006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "不过心这种东西。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6825007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "不就是用来破碎的吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6825008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "一动就碎。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6825009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "你身后的家伙又是谁嘛。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6825010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "从刚才开始，就一直紧盯着人家不放。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6825011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "所以无论如何，都非得要打架了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6825012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "我在履行义务。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6825013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "你有挣扎拒捕的权利。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6825014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "听起来就很让人害怕呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6825015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "虽然人家什么都不知道，但女孩子打起架来就不美了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6825016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "警探大人，难道不能坐下来好好解决的吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6830001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "不用试了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6830002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "再来几次还是一样。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6830003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "警探大人，人家要报警了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6830004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "你们人多欺负人少。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6830005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "我要写检举信告诉你的上司。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6830006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "在信里，我会对他说：",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6830007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "先生先生，你的下属涉嫌恐吓儿童，还有暴力执法。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6830008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6830009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "唔……完全没有胜算了呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6830010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "既然这样的话……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6830011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "嘻嘻，只好伸出手来，乖乖被你抓捕喽。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6830012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "从今天起，也要努力帮助人家变的更好哟♠。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6830013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6830014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "警探大人该不会是心动了吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6830015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "不然干嘛只盯着人家，而不舍得动手呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6830016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6830017",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "把主人！还给我！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6830018",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "优纪挥动球棒跳起的一瞬间，在刺耳尖锐的刹车声和司机骂骂咧咧的声响中，物流货车就这样茫然停在原野之中。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6830019",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "车上运载的木箱因为巨大的惯性，如散架一般四散在荒原后，露出了包裹在其中的黄澄澄、亮晶晶的保险箱。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6830020",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "而绯野原爱的面容就倒映在上面，她的脸上再次露出了那种无所畏惧，狡黠残忍的笑容。",
          "type": "narration"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-312",
