      "title": "盛情难却·Ⅲ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "6885001",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "晚间10:30，急速行驶的卡车上，可以依稀遥望远处城市的灯火。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6885002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "你回来了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6885003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "我回来了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6885004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "那些火星移民的家伙很不好对付。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6885005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "我跟花迦费了一些功夫。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6885006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "谢谢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6885007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "你知道优纪拼命抓着的气球里没有钥匙。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6885008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "我知道。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6885009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "你也知道【|101|】主人|102|并未被关在保险箱里。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6885010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "是。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6885011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "里面真正藏着的，是你一直想要的东西吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6885012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6885013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "从什么时候开始。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6885014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "最开始。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6885015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "现在你如愿以偿了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6885016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6885017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "我在那个时候竟然真的以为……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6885018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "你会把那个傻傻的女孩平安带回来。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-315",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "exceldata",
          "rowIds": [
            6885001,
            6885002,
            6885003,
            6885004,
            6885005,
            6885006,
            6885007,
            6885008,
            6885009,
            6885010,
            6885011,
            6885012,
